Subject: [PATCH 2366/3799] soh: rename func_8086D8BC ->
 BgBdanSwitch_SetupHeavyHalfPress

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: installs the half-press action
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Bdan_Switch/z_bg_bdan_switch.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 .../overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Bdan_Switch/z_bg_bdan_switch.c  | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Bdan_Switch/z_bg_bdan_switch.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Bdan_Switch/z_bg_bdan_switch.c
